ntity.lean#L66-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassIdentityC.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassIdentityC.mk","kind":"ctor","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/ArchimedeanMassIdentity.lean#L65-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassIdentityC.toArchimedeanMassIdentity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassIdentityC.toArchimedeanMassIdentity","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/ArchimedeanMassIdentity.lean#L65-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.MassIdentityC","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.MassIdentityC","kind":"structure","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/ArchimedeanMassIdentity.lean#L63-L72","doc":"**Corollary (ℂ mass identity).**\nLaTeX: `\\label{cor:mass-identity-C}` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity.integrand_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity.integrand_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/ArchimedeanMassIdentity.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The integrand is non-negative on the cycle.  An **order** condition, and\nthe reason this structure cannot live in the generic core. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity.sp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity.sp","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/ArchimedeanMassIdentity.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The substrate parameter `q : M → ℝ`.  Archimedean by construction: its\n`field` is ordered and bounded below by `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/ArchimedeanMassIdentity.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity.toMassIdentity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity.toMassIdentity","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/ArchimedeanMassIdentity.lean#L54-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.ArchimedeanMassIdentity","kind":"structure","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/ArchimedeanMassIdentity.lean#L47-L61","doc":"**Archimedean realisation of the mass identity.**\n\nThe generic core plus exactly what needs the wall: the substrate parameter,\nand the non-negativity of the integrand on the cycle.\n\nAn `ℝ`-instantiation of `MassIdentity` — the core's ring is fixed here and\nnowhere earlier. ","signatureChunk":0}]}